# Shell scripts and everything under deploy/ run on Linux — systemd units, the
# Caddyfile, environment examples and the scripts piped to the server over SSH.
# A CRLF in any of them is a `$'\r': command not found` or a unit systemd
# misreads, and core.autocrlf=true on a Windows checkout produces exactly that.
*.sh        text eol=lf
deploy/**   text eol=lf

# Third-party code vendored unchanged (pdf.js, PDF-VIEW-1): kept byte-for-byte as
# published, so it still matches the registry checksum in its README.
public/vendor/** -text
